# Product Carbon service configuration. Copy to service/.env (git-ignored).

# --- Provider ----------------------------------------------------------------
# One provider, or several in the order to try them. With gemini,anthropic the
# free Gemini tier answers first and Claude answers only if Gemini cannot (daily
# limit reached, service down, unusable output). Default: anthropic.
# PCF_AI_PROVIDER=gemini,anthropic
#
# Pick a model per provider (optional):
# PCF_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash
# PCF_ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5

# Gemini: free API tier. Create a key at https://aistudio.google.com ("Get API
# key", in a NEW project with no billing linked, so it stays free). No
# subscription needed. Within Google's daily limits there is no charge.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Anthropic: paid, pay as you go. Create a key at https://console.anthropic.com/
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Model -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gemini:
#   gemini-3.6-flash   default for gemini, free tier
#                      (gemini-2.5-flash is no longer offered to new users)
# Anthropic:
#   claude-haiku-4-5   default for anthropic, roughly $0.02 per new estimate
#   claude-sonnet-5    better reasoning, roughly $0.04-0.07
#   claude-opus-5      best quality, roughly $0.20-0.45
# With a single provider, PCF_AI_MODEL also works:
# PCF_AI_MODEL=

# Sonnet 5 / Opus 5 only: low | medium | high | xhigh | max
# PCF_AI_EFFORT=high

# Haiku 4.5 only: 0 = no extended thinking (cheapest). Otherwise 1024 or more,
# and below PCF_AI_MAX_TOKENS. Thinking tokens are billed as output.
# PCF_AI_THINKING_BUDGET=0

# PCF_AI_MAX_TOKENS=16000

# --- Cost controls -------------------------------------------------------------
# Repeat searches for the same product, region and details are answered from
# cache at no cost. 0 disables the cache.
# PCF_CACHE_TTL_DAYS=30

# New (uncached) AI estimates allowed per client per hour. 0 = unlimited.
# PCF_RATE_LIMIT_PER_HOUR=30

# PCF_CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173
